1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,731
And here is why it matters.

2
00:00:01,731 --> 00:00:05,429
The impulse cannot travel under the insulating myelin.

3
00:00:05,429 --> 00:00:09,127
It jumps from node to node: saltatory conduction.

4
00:00:09,127 --> 00:00:13,151
That makes a myelinated fibre up to a hundred times faster.

